        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, freight, rail, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, freight, rail, diesel
Based on European railway freight transport;
UUID: f1531262-cef0-3baa-af7c-0fa46b35a111
Based on European railway freight transport; instead of mix of electric and diesel trains it includes operation of diesel train only. This dataset calls the modules "operation of vehicle"; "production, maintenance and disposal of vehicles"; "construction and maintenance and disposal of railway tracks".
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and statistics 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f1531262-cef0-3baa-af7c-0fa46b35a111.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
